COMPILATION OF: E52WJ

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52WJ

   1 a 0000 E52WJ: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006 
   3 a 0006    /* E52WJ probe (PLAN sec P3-10 panel F): SIGNAL under a
   4 a 0006       measured ON ERROR handler. E52UE measured the
   5 a 0006       registration on_error_reg_prefix (C366): 21 01 00 /
   6 a 0006       AF / CD ?ONCOP / C3 over. Predict H-F: adding the
   7 a 0006       signal does NOT change the registration bytes, adds
   8 a 0006       exactly the 7-byte SIGNAL region after the jump-over
   9 a 0006       target, keeps the returning handler SP-cell-free
  10 a 0006       (DATA 0002), and introduces no new prescan demand. */
  11 a 0006 
  12 c 0006    dcl x fixed bin;
  13 c 0006 
  14 c 0006    on error(1) x = 1;
  15 c 0016    signal error(1);
  16 c 001E    x = 2;
  17 c 0024 
  18 a 0024 end E52WJ;

CODE SIZE = 0027
DATA AREA = 0002
FREE SYMS = 38C0
END  COMPILATION
